## Risk Factors

- **AI Disruption:** Models #12, #13 have Lindy < 10y. AI capabilities shift fast — today's wrapper is tomorrow's built-in feature. Mitigate with proprietary data/workflow.
- **Platform Dependency:** Models #7, #10, #11 depend on Google/Amazon algorithms. Mitigate with email list + multi-platform.
- **Power Law:** In ALL models, P10 ≈ $0. Top 10% capture 70-80% of revenue. Median outcome is near-zero for most entrants. Success requires niche specificity + execution speed.
- **Burnout:** 54% solo founder burnout rate [SOURCE: solobusinesshub.com, 2026]. Cap at 30-35h/week sustainable.

