## Operator Mastery (5-Layer Summary)

**L1 TIMING:** Invoice Tuesday 10AM → 26 days faster payment (63% improvement). At $2K/mo = $247/year float value.
**L2 REFLEXIVITY:** Position neutral (0.125). Don't reveal you need this more than they do.
**L3 NETWORK:** Hub score 50/100 = viable. Build stickiness before scaling.
**L4 COGNITIVE:** 60 days runway = optimization mode. 28% capacity. Risk: overconfidence bias.
**L5 DEAL:** Customer Prepay is your ONLY option. CCC = -74 days. You are FUNDED by customers.

